Alias Conrad Coldwood (commonly abbreviated as ACC) is a musician, artist, and game developer. As one half of [[Unproductive Fun Time]], he collaborated with [[Mortis Ghost]] on the original 2008 release of OFF, for which he composed the original soundtrack and contributed significantly to its development.

==== Music in the OFF remaster ====

Alias Conrad Coldwood’s original music was not used in the OFF remake due to legal and personal concerns. Since OFF was originally a free project, Coldwood freely sampled other artists for the soundtrack. For the commercial re-release, Fangamer's contract required him to confirm full ownership of the music. Although they offered to handle sample clearance, Coldwood was uneasy about the contract’s wording and potential legal risks. 

He was also worried the music might be added to Content ID systems, potentially taking down old fan uploads (contradicting his long-standing openness toward use of his music.) As he also didn't have time to create new tracks if requested, he chose to decline the offer.

Coldwood emphasized that the decision not to include the original soundtrack was entirely his, and expressed appreciation for Fangamer, describing their communication as respectful and patient throughout the process. <ref>[[:File:ACC Email.jpg]]</ref>

/* Messagebox templates */
.messagebox {
	border: 3px solid #5D5C5A;
	background-color: var(--background);
	width: 60%;
	margin: 0 auto 1em auto;
	padding: .2em;
}
.messagebox.merge {
	border: 1px solid #5D5C5A;
	background-color: #000000;
	text-align: center;
}
.messagebox.cleanup {
	border: 1px solid #5D5C5A;
	background-color: #000000;
	text-align: center;
}
.messagebox.standard-talk {
	border: 1px solid #5D5C5A;
	background-color: #000000;
	margin: 4px auto;
}
/* For old WikiProject banners inside banner shells. */
.mbox-inside .standard-talk,
.messagebox.nested-talk {
	border: 1px solid #5D5C5A;
	background-color: #000000;
	width: 100%;
	margin: 2px 0;
	padding: 2px;
}
.messagebox.small {
	width: 238px;
	font-size: 85%;
	/* @noflip */
	float: right;
	clear: both;
	/* @noflip */
	margin: 0 0 1em 1em;
	line-height: 1.25em;
}
.messagebox.small-talk {
	width: 238px;
	font-size: 85%;
	/* @noflip */
	float: right;
	clear: both;
	/* @noflip */
	margin: 0 0 1em 1em;
	line-height: 1.25em;
	background-color: #000000;
}
/* [[Category:Template stylesheets]] */
